LG:
  - Lightweight GL
  - Leyun's GL

Geometry management hierarchy:

  GLGeometry  (abstract: SetVertexAttributes, Buffer, Draw)
  ├── GLCompositeGeometry           [contains a list of child GLGeometry objects]
  ├── GLTransformedGeometry         [wraps any GLGeometry with a model matrix]
  └── GLPrimitiveGeometry  (abstract: adds GetVertexArray/Buffer, GetDimension/NVertex/Vertex)
      ├── GLPrimitiveGeometryDecorator   [identity decorator wrapping a GLPrimitiveGeometry]
      │   └── GLColoredGeometry  (abstract: adds a per-vertex color buffer)
      │       ├── GLSingleColorGeometry   [fills all vertices with one color]
      │       └── GLRandomColorGeometry   [assigns random colors to vertices]
      └── GLElementGeometry  (abstract: owns VAO/VBO; adds Bind, SetUniforms, IssueBuffer, IssueDraw)
          └── GLElementGeometryD<D>  [template; D=2 or D=3; owns typed vertex list]
              ├── GLTriangle          (D=3)
              ├── GLSphere            (D=3)
              ├── GLAxes              (D=3)
              ├── GLCircle            (D=2)
              ├── GLSmell             (D=2)
              ├── SierpinskiGasket    (D=2)
              ├── SierpinskiGasket2   (D=2)
              ├── KochSnowflake       (D=2)
              ├── BarnsleyFern        (D=2)
              └── Maze                (D=2)

Memo on caveats:
  - Avoid duplicate Geometry::SetVertexAttributes() and Geometry::Buffer() calls for the same object in the scene graph.
